{"id":"9403bcdfde263660","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-reach.md","title":"REACH问题","display":"df-reach — REACH问题","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-reach","aliases":["29-df-reach"],"display":"df-reach — REACH问题","depends_on":["[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition3.13, p.50 scan65; Theorem3.23 p.53 scan68"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-reach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-reach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reach — REACH问题"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition3.13, p.50 scan65; Theorem3.23 p.53 scan68"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in|G|\">\\(s,t\\in|G|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_g=\\langle E^{(2)},s,t\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_g=\\langle E^{(2)},s,t\\rangle\\)</span> 是带指定端点的图词汇。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a>；结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的图约化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span> 由下式构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH},\\mathrm{REACH}_d,\\mathrm{REACH}_u\">\\(\\mathrm{REACH},\\mathrm{REACH}_d,\\mathrm{REACH}_u\\)</span> 保留三元组输入接口；带上标std的版本是标准数值结构上的布尔查询，供完全性结果使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{card}\\{u\\in|G|\\mid(v,u)\\in E^G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{card}\\{u\\in|G|\\mid(v,u)\\in E^G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ v_i\\in|G|\\ (0\\leq i\\leq m),\\ v_0=s,\\ v_m=t,\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ v_i\\in|G|\\ (0\\leq i\\leq m),\\ v_0=s,\\ v_m=t,\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}],\\ s,t\\in|G|,\\ \\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}],\\ s,t\\in|G|,\\ \\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\;\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v_i)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\;\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v_i)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_{\\mathrm{func}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall v\\in|G|\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\leq1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}_u\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;((u,v)\\in E^G\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}_{\\mathrm{func}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall v\\in|G|\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\leq1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}_u\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;((u,v)\\in E^G\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_A\\coloneqq\\langle|A|,E^A\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_A\\coloneqq\\langle|A|,E^A\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_d^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}_d^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition3.13，印刷页50、扫描页65，及Theorem3.23，印刷页53、扫描页68。确定路径只要求实际路径各步的出边唯一；终点及不在路径上的顶点可以分叉。旧定义误要求全图函数性，现将其保留为不同子类REACHfunc，恢复REACHd原书含义。零步路径仍允许s=t。结构查询版本显式纳入端点常量和书中默认标准数值背景，避免把未编码的外部三元组直接传入复杂性类/FO结构归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_g=\\langle E^{(2)},s,t\\rangle$ 是带指定端点的图词汇。$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]；结构 $A$ 的图约化 $G_A$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in|G|","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_g=\\langle E^{(2)},s,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REACH},\\mathrm{REACH}_d,\\mathrm{REACH}_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{card}\\{u\\in|G|\\mid(v,u)\\in E^G\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ v_i\\in|G|\\ (0\\leq i\\leq m),\\ v_0=s,\\ v_m=t,\\ \\forall i<m\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^G\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REACH}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}],\\ s,t\\in|G|,\\ \\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in\\operatorname{Path}(G,s,t)\\;\\forall i<m\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v_i)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REACH}_{\\mathrm{func}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall v\\in|G|\\;\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)\\leq1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}_u\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\mid\\forall u,v\\in|G|\\;((u,v)\\in E^G\\leftrightarrow(v,u)\\in E^G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_A\\coloneqq\\langle|A|,E^A\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REACH}_d^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_g]\\mid\\langle G_A,s^A,t^A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}_d\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2485,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecf0316ce54c8b96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]$，$s,t\\in|G|$；$V_\\exists,V_\\forall\\subseteq|G|$ 是不交且并为 $|G|$ 的标记集，见 [[29-df-reach]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-reach]] — `\\mathrm{REACH}` 与 `\\mathrm{REACH}_d`"},{"id":"e33d8f1b508c3705","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2a4804023516b8f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-reach]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-reach]]"}],"outgoing":["4563061cac782dab","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}